    "result_text": "The test passes. The build (which runs `vite build` + `tsc` for the front-end) and the full e2e loop completed successfully.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented \"one place that lists all invoices from every project, showing the project and stage\" as a small, additive full-stack change. No DB migration was needed \u2014 the `invoice`/`project` tables and the `/__test__` seed already support the fixture shape.\n\n**Server (OfficeFloor REST):**\n- `InvoiceView.java` \u2014 an invoice + its project **name**, mirroring how `ProjectView` carries the client's name.\n- `InvoicesAllGet.java` \u2014 `GET /api/invoices/all`, joining every invoice against its project server-side (oldest first).\n- `rest/api/invoices/all.GET.yml` \u2014 wires the endpoint (a new YAML file, path under `/api/`).\n\n**Front-end (all new files, nothing edited):**\n- `features/invoices/nav.slot.tsx` \u2014 fills `AppNav` with the `nav-invoices` link to `/invoices`.\n- `routes/invoices.tsx` \u2014 the `/invoices` leaf route (route tree is generated).\n- `features/invoices/AllInvoicesPage.tsx` \u2014 reads `['invoices', 'all']` via `useQuery` (key still starts with `invoices`, so existing write-invalidations refresh it) and renders the table.\n\n**data-testid anchors matched to the spec:** `nav-invoices`, `all-invoices-table`, `invoice-row-<id>`, `invoice-project` (project name), `invoice-status` (stage). I reused the existing `invoice-status`/`invoice-amount` conventions and added no renames.\n\nResult: `1 passed`.",
